      "1": {
        "description": {
          "type": "String",
          "value": "<p>Once per scene, you can grab the exact tool you need that moment from a pocket or your surroundings. Usually, these are mundane tools like a crowbar, but if you are willing to invest an icon relationship roll, you can produce unique items, such as official documents. Explain how you got the item with a flashback scene. These items have one use, so that wand of fireballs will have one charge and that&rsquo;s it.</p>"
        },
